---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | FindPIAttorney.com"
  description="Learn how FindPIAttorney.com collects, uses, and protects your personal information when you use our attorney directory."
  canonical="https://www.findpiattorney.com/privacy-policy"
>
  <Header />
  <main class="flex-1">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-brand-900 text-white py-14">
      <div class="page-container text-center">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white/10 text-white text-xs font-semibold px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full mb-4 border border-white/20">
          Legal Document
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-brand-200 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm">
          We respect your privacy and are committed to being fully transparent about how we handle your data.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-brand-300">Last Updated: August 17, 2026 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Effective: August 17, 2026</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="page-container section-padding">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">

        <!-- Quick Summary Card -->
        <div class="bg-brand-50 border border-brand-200 rounded-2xl p-6 mb-10">
          <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-brand-900 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wide">The Short Version</h2>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-brand-800">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> We do not sell or rent your personal information — ever.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> Attorney data is sourced from public bar records, not from users.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> We only collect minimal data needed to operate the site.</li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="text-brand-500 mt-0.5">✓</span> You can contact us at any time to exercise your privacy rights.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">

          <!-- Section 1 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">1. Who We Are</h2>
            <p>
              FindPIAttorney.com ("we," "us," or "our") is an independent online directory of personal injury attorneys licensed to practice in Florida and New Jersey. We operate solely as an informational service. We are not a law firm, attorney referral service, or legal counsel of any kind.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              Our website is located at <strong>https://www.findpiattorney.com</strong>. For any privacy-related questions, you may contact us at <a href="mailto:info@findpiattorney.com" class="text-brand-700 underline font-medium">info@findpiattorney.com</a>.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 2 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <p class="mb-3">We collect two categories of information:</p>

            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">A. Information You Voluntarily Provide</h3>
            <p>When you contact us through our contact form or by email, you may provide your name, email address, and message content. We use this solely to respond to your inquiry.</p>

            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 mt-4 mb-2">B. Information Collected Automatically</h3>
            <p>When you visit our website, our hosting infrastructure and analytics tools may automatically collect:</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Your IP address (anonymized where possible)</li>
              <li>Browser type, version, and operating system</li>
              <li>Pages visited and time spent on each page</li>
              <li>Referring URL (the site you came from)</li>
              <li>Date and time of your visit</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-3">
              <strong>Note:</strong> We do not use tracking cookies for advertising or cross-site profiling. Any analytics we use are configured to respect user privacy and comply with applicable data protection laws.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 3 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <p>We use the limited information we collect for the following lawful purposes:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> To respond to contact form submissions and support inquiries</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> To monitor website performance and fix technical issues</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> To improve the quality, accuracy, and usability of our directory</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> To comply with applicable legal obligations</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> To detect, prevent, and address fraud or security threats</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">We will never use your personal information for unsolicited marketing communications without your explicit consent.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 4 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">4. Attorney Listing Data</h2>
            <p>
              Attorney profiles on this website are compiled from <strong>publicly available records</strong> maintained by state bar associations, including The Florida Bar and the New Jersey State Bar. This information — including names, bar numbers, firm affiliations, and addresses — is public record and does not constitute private personal data under most applicable privacy frameworks.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3">
              If you are an attorney listed on this site and wish to request a correction, update, or removal of your information, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@findpiattorney.com" class="text-brand-700 underline font-medium">info@findpiattorney.com</a>. We will review all such requests promptly.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 5 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">5. Information Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
            <p><strong>We do not sell, rent, lease, or trade your personal information to any third party.</strong></p>
            <p class="mt-3">We may disclose information only in the following limited circumstances:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <span><strong>Legal compliance:</strong> When required by law, court order, subpoena, or governmental regulation</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <span><strong>Rights protection:</strong> To protect the rights, property, or safety of our users, the public, or ourselves</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <span><strong>Service providers:</strong> To trusted third-party vendors who assist us in operating the website (e.g., hosting providers), under strict confidentiality agreements</span></li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <span><strong>Business transfers:</strong> In connection with a merger, acquisition, or sale of assets, where your information would remain subject to this policy</span></li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 6 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">6. Cookies & Tracking Technologies</h2>
            <p>Our website may use cookies — small text files stored on your device — to:</p>
            <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 list-disc list-inside text-sm">
              <li>Remember your preferences during a session</li>
              <li>Understand how visitors use our site (analytics only)</li>
              <li>Improve site performance and user experience</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-3">
              You may configure your browser to refuse cookies or alert you when cookies are being sent. Note that some features of the website may not function properly if cookies are disabled. We do not use third-party advertising cookies or behavioral tracking.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 7 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">7. Data Security</h2>
            <p>
              We implement commercially reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to protect your information against unauthorized access, disclosure, alteration, and destruction. Our website is served over HTTPS with TLS encryption. However, no method of internet transmission or electronic storage is 100% secure. We cannot guarantee absolute security, and you transmit information to us at your own risk.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 8 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">8. Your Privacy Rights</h2>
            <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have the following rights:</p>
            <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm">
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <strong>Access:</strong> Request a copy of the personal information we hold about you</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <strong>Correction:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete information</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <strong>Deletion:</strong> Request deletion of your personal data, subject to legal retention requirements</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <strong>Objection:</strong> Object to certain types of processing</li>
              <li class="flex gap-2"><span class="text-brand-600 font-bold">→</span> <strong>Portability:</strong> Request your data in a portable, machine-readable format</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="mt-4">To exercise any of these rights, please contact us at <a href="mailto:info@findpiattorney.com" class="text-brand-700 underline font-medium">info@findpiattorney.com</a>. We will respond to your request within 30 days.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 9 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">9. Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>
              Our website is not directed to individuals under the age of 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, please contact us immediately and we will take steps to delete such information.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 10 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">10. Third-Party Links</h2>
            <p>
              Our website may contain links to third-party websites, including state bar association portals and legal resources. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of those sites and encourage you to review their respective privacy policies before providing any personal information.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 11 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">11. Changes to This Policy</h2>
            <p>
              We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time to reflect changes in our practices or applicable law. When we make material changes, we will update the "Last Updated" date at the top of this page. We encourage you to review this policy periodically. Your continued use of this website after any changes constitutes your acceptance of the revised policy.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Section 12 -->
          <div class="border-l-4 border-brand-500 pl-6">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">12. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>For questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please reach out to us:</p>
            <div class="mt-4 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-5 text-sm space-y-2">
              <p><strong>FindPIAttorney.com</strong></p>
              <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@findpiattorney.com" class="text-brand-700 underline font-medium">info@findpiattorney.com</a></p>
              <p>Response time: Within 30 business days</p>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
